     }
+    // the pass bang's body (skipped: the host served it) would sink its Terms ws,
+    // x, eb, hb, tb (fields 1, 2, 49, 51, 64; y, field 3, is the result) and
+    // FID_ENTER would free its words; a parked task does neither, so each step left
+    // x (2^12 F32), the task words and the lends: ~17 KB a token
+    // (tools/payload-passdrop.patch). Both here, on device lane 0's allocator:
+    // bend_dev runs on this stream, never beside it, and its dev_cut banks the rest
